 ## [Unreleased]
 
+## [0.4.0] - 2026-11-07
+
+### Added
+
+- **Tool input validation.** `ToolRegistry.execute` now validates tool arguments against the declared
+  `inputSchema` using Ajv before the executor runs. A malformed call returns a `ToolResponse` with
+  the validation error in `result`, which allows the model to see and correct its mistake on the next
+  round rather than throwing a transport error. Validation error messages name the failing field paths
+  and constraints but never the property values, so sensitive data in a malformed call does not leak
+  to logs.
+
+### Changed
+
+- Static tool schemas are compiled once at registration time, and invalid schemas throw immediately
+  to prevent runtime failures. Function-valued tool schemas are resolved per call and cached by schema
+  object reference.
+- `ToolRegistry.execute` doc comment now points at the full contract in `specs/hal-engine-tool-input-validation/spec.md`.
+
 ## [0.3.0] - 2026-09-17
 
 ### Changed
